{
  "name": "Generate social captions with Caption-Pack API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate social captions with Caption-Pack API\n\n**Who it's for:** automation tinkerers, indie devs, and AI-agent builders who want captions + hashtags without an LLM in the loop.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Fill in the form (topic, audience, tone, platform, count).\n2. The HTTP Request node calls `POST /v1/caption-pack` on the Caption-Pack API.\n3. A Code node formats the returned pack into readable text.\n4. The completion page shows your captions — copy and post.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Get a free API key (25 calls, no card): open https://caption-pack-api.onrender.com/v1/free-trial in your browser — the key is shown once, save it.\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential: Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer ` followed by your key.\n3. Open the **Call Caption-Pack API** node and select that credential.\n4. Click **Test workflow**, fill the form, submit.\n\nEach run costs 1 credit. Check your balance any time at `GET /v1/balance` with the same header. Full API contract: https://caption-pack-api.onrender.com/openapi.yaml\n\n**Like it?** Free 25 credits (no card) -> $10 for 500. One Stripe click. No subscription: https://caption-pack-api.onrender.com/v1/checkout\n",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "53c77010-3e28-4908-b452-f3dec79008c1",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
